  "release_changes": [
    "Find Word replies through the verified frame when point and native-host provider trees omit the exact live editor.",
    "Give startup and in-flight focus lookups bounded recovery grace so healthy helpers are not retired before valid results finish; retain the 150 ms caller wait.",
    "Rediscover rejected cached comment providers and cancel pending helper recovery only after current-session live validation.",
    "Retry ambiguous empty OLE clipboard views only on the unchanged sequence and restore format-free backups with an ownership-checked native clear.",
    "Distinguish ordinary clipboard refusal from helper failure without recording clipboard contents or relaxing unsupported-format and newer-item safeguards."
